### Register a STANDARD customer
# The id is stored globally so that the CDR and report requests can reuse it.
POST {{host}}/v1/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "standard-{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "name": "Bob Standard",
  "plan": "STANDARD"
}

### Register a PREMIUM customer
POST {{host}}/v1/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "premium-{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "name": "Alice Premium",
  "plan": "PREMIUM"
}


### Get a customer by id
GET {{host}}/v1/customers/1
Accept: application/json
